 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "SparseMatrix(matrix) stores a dense rows x cols integer matrix (rows, cols >= 1) keeping only non-zero entries. get(row, col) returns the entry. set(row, col, value) overwrites it. add(other) takes a dense matrix of the same shape and returns the sum as its non-zero entries [row, col, value] sorted by row then column, without changing the stored matrix. multiply(other) takes a dense cols x k matrix and returns the product the same way. Every method call is answered in call order on one instance; void methods return nothing.",
  "provenance": [
